flowchart TD
    RESP["response"] --> POK{parse ok?}
    POK -->|yes| MAP["map DTO to domain"]
    POK -->|unknown field| IGN["ignore, ok"]
    POK -->|unknown enum| UNK["UNKNOWN fallback + telemetry"]
    POK -->|type/shape broke| ERR["typed error + drift alert"]
    MAP --> STABLE["stable domain"]
    ERR --> BW{breaking and widespread?}
    BW -->|yes| MIN["min-version forced upgrade"]
    BW -->|no| HOT["client hotfix mapper"]
